event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":1,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"質問があります：\n\n1. **このプロジェクト（Claude Code Router）に Flutter 開発環境を追加したい**の"}       }

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":1,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"か、それとも\n2. **別の Flutter プロジェクト向けに**"}    }

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":1,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"一般的な Dev Container 設定を知りたいのか\n\nどちらのケースかで"}            }

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":1,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"、対応が異なります。\n\n## 一般的な Flutter の devcontainer.json 設定例\n\n参"}      }

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":1,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"考までに、基本的な構成は以下のようになります：\n\n```json\n{\n  \"name\": \"Flutter Development\",\n  \"image\": \"mcr"}       }

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":1,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":".microsoft.com/devcontainers/flutter:1-latest\",\n  \"features\": {\n    \"ghcr"} }

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":1,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":".io/devcontainers/features/android:1\": {\n      \"acceptAndroidSdk\": true"}               }

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":1,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"\n    }\n  },\n  \"customizations\": {\n    \"vscode\": {\n      \"extensions\": [\n        \"Dart-Code."}             }

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":1,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"flutter\",\n        \"Dart-Code.dart-code\"\n      ]\n    }\n  "}  }

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":1,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"},\n  \"postCreateCommand\": \"flutter pub get\"\n}\n```\n\n**重要な要素：**\n- `image`: Flutter"}         }

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":1,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" 公式イメージ（Android SDK も含む）\n- `acceptAndroidSdk`: Android SDK ライ"}             }

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":1,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"センス自動承認\n- `extensions`: VS Code の Flutter/"}       }

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":1,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"Dart 拡張\n\n---\n\n**このプロジェクトに Flutter を追加する"}     }

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":1,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"のであれば、現在の `.devcontainer/devcontainer.json` を確認した上で、具体的な設定を"}            }

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":1,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"お手伝いできます。どちらのケースでしょうか？**"}     }

